  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-HEAP-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Then the old bosses escape and start again. I never have a free moment! I haven't eaten dinner in weeks! But... what else can I do? Let them run rampant?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Hero_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Dog_Tracy_LM-HEAP_028.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1524747,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-HEAP-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You can try a different tactic, try reaching out and making them part of the community you want to build. After all, we're stuck here together.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Deer_Hero_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Shadoe_LM-HEAP_038.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1524754,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-HEAP-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Fine. Then together, let's go to Tamarin House and see if the Golden Lion wants to roll over and play nice.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Dog_Hero_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Dog_Tracy_LM-HEAP_029.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1524747,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Old One Screen",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Apologies for the difficulties, My Scion. Certain external Schisms prevented me from finishing this test as I wanted.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/Art_Portrait_Screen_Keyboard.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Old_One_Screen_LM-HEAP_031.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Old One Screen",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But then... perhaps that is for the best. A Hero can't just tread the beaten path. It takes a real completionist to make a world.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/Art_Portrait_Screen_Keyboard.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Old_One_Screen_LM-HEAP_032.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Old One Screen",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "That said, I realize now that some aspects of the Spiral aren't worth preserving. Monsters and reprobates, degenerations of all the First World was.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/Art_Portrait_Screen_Keyboard.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Old_One_Screen_LM-HEAP_033.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Old One Screen",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "How can I be expected to rebuild it with them here? Thus I've constructed this trash heap of the disposables, which I shall periodically... expunge.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/Art_Portrait_Screen_Keyboard.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Old_One_Screen_LM-HEAP_034.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "",
            "m_nameOverride": "Old One Screen",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Pay close attention to whatever you find here. To remake the First World, you must discern the reject stock.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/QuestButtons/Art_Portrait_Screen_Keyboard.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Old_One_Screen_LM-HEAP_035.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-HEAP-NPC13_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Who am I? Ain't you figured it out? I'm the source of all Mana, the one-time secret king of Heap. I am the Golden Lion.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Golden_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Golden_Lion_LM-HEAP_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1524760,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
